<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Chariot cautions shareholders on talks.</title>
<headline>Chariot cautions shareholders on talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Chariot Holdings Ltd, the new name for Harveys Curnow Ltd, on Thursday advised shareholders to exercise caution in dealings in its shares.</p>
<p>The firm warned that talks that may affect its share price are still continuing.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
